{"id":"leetcode-459","version":1,"status":"approved","title":"Repeated Substring Pattern","summary":"Determine if a string can be formed by repeating a substring.","statement":"Determine if a string can be formed by repeating a substring.","constraints":["1 <= s.length <= 10,000; lowercase English letters only.","The entire string must equal at least two copies of one nonempty substring. A shared prefix/suffix alone is not enough."],"topics":["strings","string-matching"],"prerequisites":[],"signature":{"name":"repeated_substring_pattern","parameters":[{"name":"s","annotation":"str","adapter":"raw","source_parameter":null}],"returns":"bool","return_adapter":"raw","node_policy":"values","result_mode":"return","mutated_parameter":null,"immutable_parameters":[]},"starter_code":"def repeated_substring_pattern(s: str) -> bool:\n    # Write your solution here.\n    pass\n","reference_solution":"def repeated_substring_pattern(s):\n    prefix = [0]*len(s)\n    for i in range(1,len(s)):\n        length = prefix[i-1]\n        while length and s[i]!=s[length]:\n            length = prefix[length-1]\n        if s[i]==s[length]:\n            length += 1\n        prefix[i] = length\n    period = len(s)-prefix[-1]\n    return prefix[-1]>0 and len(s)%period==0\n","brute_force_solution":null,"known_wrong_solutions":["def repeated_substring_pattern(s):\n    prefix = [0]*len(s)\n    for i in range(1,len(s)):\n        length = prefix[i-1]\n        while length and s[i]!=s[length]:\n            length = prefix[length-1]\n        if s[i]==s[length]:\n            length += 1\n        prefix[i] = length\n    period = len(s)-prefix[-1]\n    return prefix[-1]>0\n","def repeated_substring_pattern(s):\n    return len(s)%2==0 and s[:len(s)//2]==s[len(s)//2:]\n"],"target_time_complexity":"O(n)","target_space_complexity":"O(n)","estimated_minutes":20,"rubric":{"algorithmic_insight":1,"prerequisites":1,"implementation":1,"performance_pressure":0,"edge_cases":0},"hints":["A repeated string has a proper prefix that is also a suffix.","Compute the longest border with a prefix-function table, then consider period n-border.","Build prefix lengths with fallback links. Return true only if the final border is nonzero and n is divisible by n-border.","Divisibility ensures complete copies; a single-character string has no proper border and cannot repeat twice."],"editorial":"The prefix function finds the longest proper border in linear time. Its complement is the smallest candidate period; it describes full repetition precisely when it divides the string length. The oracle explicitly tries every possible block length and concatenates copies.","tests":[{"id":"lc-459-1","arguments":["abab"],"expected":true,"comparator":"exact","visible":true,"explanation":"Two copies of ab produce the whole string.","expected_node_order":null},{"id":"lc-459-2","arguments":["ababa"],"expected":false,"comparator":"exact","visible":true,"explanation":"Although aba is both a prefix and suffix, a length-2 period does not divide length 5; partial final copies do not count.","expected_node_order":null},{"id":"lc-459-3","arguments":["a"],"expected":false,"comparator":"exact","visible":false,"explanation":null,"expected_node_order":null},{"id":"lc-459-4","arguments":["aa"],"expected":true,"comparator":"exact","visible":false,"explanation":null,"expected_node_order":null},{"id":"lc-459-5","arguments":["aaa"],"expected":true,"comparator":"exact","visible":false,"explanation":null,"expected_node_order":null},{"id":"lc-459-6","arguments":["ab"],"expected":false,"comparator":"exact","visible":false,"explanation":null,"expected_node_order":null},{"id":"lc-459-7","arguments":["aba"],"expected":false,"comparator":"exact","visible":false,"explanation":null,"expected_node_order":null},{"id":"lc-459-8","arguments":["abcabcabc"],"expected":true,"comparator":"exact","visible":false,"explanation":null,"expected_node_order":null},{"id":"lc-459-9","arguments":["abcabcxabc"],"expected":false,"comparator":"exact","visible":false,"explanation":null,"expected_node_order":null},{"id":"lc-459-10","arguments":["aaaaab"],"expected":false,"comparator":"exact","visible":false,"explanation":null,"expected_node_order":null},{"id":"lc-459-11","arguments":["zzzzzz"],"expected":true,"comparator":"exact","visible":false,"explanation":null,"expected_node_order":null},{"id":"lc-459-12","arguments":["abaaba"],"expected":true,"comparator":"exact","visible":false,"explanation":null,"expected_node_order":null},{"id":"lc-459-13","arguments":["abcdabcd"],"expected":true,"comparator":"exact","visible":false,"explanation":null,"expected_node_order":null},{"id":"lc-459-14","arguments":["abac"],"expected":false,"comparator":"exact","visible":false,"explanation":null,"expected_node_order":null},{"id":"lc-459-stress-1","arguments":[""],"expected":true,"comparator":"exact","visible":false,"explanation":null,"expected_node_order":null},{"id":"lc-459-stress-2","arguments":[""],"expected":false,"comparator":"exact","visible":false,"explanation":null,"expected_node_order":null},{"id":"lc-459-stress-3","arguments":[""],"expected":true,"comparator":"exact","visible":false,"explanation":null,"expected_node_order":null}],"variation_dimensions":[],"seed_problem_id":null,"prompt_version":null}
